              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebibedo, kinde ma Yehova Mungu peri biteri i ng’om m’ekwong’o ni kwaru, ni Ibrahim, ni Isak, man ni Yakobo, ya emi iri, adhura ma dit ma ber de, m’igomo in ungo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man udi m’upong’ ku gin ceke ma ber, m’ipong’o in ungo, ku kulo m’atong’a, m’itong’o in ungo, podho mir ulok ku yendulam, m’ipidho in ungo, e ibicamu ibiyeng’ de; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e ikuri giri wii maru wil kum Yehova, m’uwodhi woko kud i ng’om Misiri, kud i ot mi ng’eca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 4:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwor Yehova Mungu peri; man itim ire, man ikwong’ ku nyinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud ilub tok mungu mange, mi mungu mi dhanu m’utieki gbur; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum Yehova Mungu peri i kindi en e Mungu ma won nyeko; ng’ecwiny pa Yehova Mungu peri maru opo i wii, man emaru nyothi kud i wang’ ng’om.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
